    <string name="sniffing_faq_title">What is Traffic Sniffing?</string>
    <string name="sniffing_faq_body">Traffic sniffing inspects packets to detect the actual protocol being used (HTTP, TLS, QUIC). This allows the VPN to route traffic more intelligently based on content rather than just destination IP.</string>
